#: src/idiomatic/leveraging-the-type-system/raii/scope_guard.md:6
msgid "Scope Guards"
msgstr ""

#: src/idiomatic/leveraging-the-type-system/raii/scope_guard.md:8
msgid ""
"A scope guard uses the `Drop` trait to run cleanup code automatically when a "
"scope exits, even during unwinding."
msgstr ""

